 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "小野",
   "source_text": "今日は二つの資料をもとに、会場の選択を話し合います。まず、青木さんから提案をお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D001-01",
    "C76-D001-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-2",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 7.382,
   "duration_sec": 7.382
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "私は条件付きでB案を支持します。週二回開けますし、示された月の費用は三万五千円です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D002-01",
    "C76-D002-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 7.732,
   "end_sec": 15.483,
   "duration_sec": 7.751
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "田辺",
   "source_text": "私は同じ会場のほうが心配が少ないです。十四人も会場が変わらないことを優先していますから、住民はA案を望んでいると言えるのではありませんか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D003-01",
    "C76-D003-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 15.833,
   "end_sec": 25.894,
   "duration_sec": 10.061
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "十四人という数字の範囲を確認したいです。それは、地域全体についての結果ではありませんよね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D004-01",
    "C76-D004-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 26.244,
   "end_sec": 33.907,
   "duration_sec": 7.663
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "はい。自分の意思で聞き取りに参加した、現在の利用者二十四人の回答です。聞き取りに参加していない人の意見は含まれていません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D005-01",
    "C76-D005-02",
    "C76-D005-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 34.257,
   "end_sec": 43.412,
   "duration_sec": 9.155
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "田辺",
   "source_text": "では、「住民はA案を望んでいる」という私の言い方は撤回します。ただ、場所への不安は残ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D006-01",
    "C76-D006-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 43.762,
   "end_sec": 50.89,
   "duration_sec": 7.128
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "小野",
   "source_text": "その点は大切ですね。支持する案と、心配している点を分けて、記録に残しましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D007-01",
    "C76-D007-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-2",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 51.24,
   "end_sec": 57.534,
   "duration_sec": 6.294
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "私は費用を少なくしたいです。でも、B案でも各会場までの経路はまだ確認していないんですよね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D008-01",
    "C76-D008-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 57.884,
   "end_sec": 65.718,
   "duration_sec": 7.834
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "そのとおりです。公共施設だから段差なく行けるとは限りません。候補ごとに確認が必要です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D009-01",
    "C76-D009-02",
    "C76-D009-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "short_pause"
   ],
   "start_sec": 66.068,
   "end_sec": 73.893,
   "duration_sec": 7.825
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "田辺",
   "source_text": "すみません、最後が聞こえませんでした。聞き返してもいいですか。何を候補ごとに確認するのか、もう一度お願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D010-01",
    "C76-D010-02",
    "C76-D010-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 74.243,
   "end_sec": 81.847,
   "duration_sec": 7.604
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "段差のない経路です。始める前に、経路と毎月の会場を確認します。条件付きというのは、未確認でも始めるという意味ではありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D011-01",
    "C76-D011-02",
    "C76-D011-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 82.197,
   "end_sec": 93.562,
   "duration_sec": 11.365
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "そこは私も同じ考えです。費用が少なくても、経路の条件に合わない会場には賛成できません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D012-01",
    "C76-D012-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 93.912,
   "end_sec": 101.157,
   "duration_sec": 7.245
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "小野",
   "source_text": "A案についてはどうでしょう。月六万円なら予算内だ、という判断はできますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D013-01",
    "C76-D013-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-2",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 101.507,
   "end_sec": 107.043,
   "duration_sec": 5.536
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "資料を読む限りでは、その六万円は部屋代です。設備の追加料金が不明なので、総費用は分かりません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D014-01",
    "C76-D014-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 107.393,
   "end_sec": 116.258,
   "duration_sec": 8.865
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "補足すると、必ず予算より高くなると判断したわけでもありません。今は、予算内だと確認できないんです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D015-01",
    "C76-D015-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 116.608,
   "end_sec": 124.53,
   "duration_sec": 7.922
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "田辺",
   "source_text": "分かりました。A案は会場が変わらない反面、費用には不明な点がある。それも説明に入れてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D016-01",
    "C76-D016-02",
    "C76-D016-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 124.88,
   "end_sec": 132.384,
   "duration_sec": 7.504
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "小野",
   "source_text": "B案の場所が変わる可能性には、どんな対策を考えていますか。連絡の方法は決まっていますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D017-01",
    "C76-D017-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-2",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 132.734,
   "end_sec": 139.636,
   "duration_sec": 6.902
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "まだ提案の段階です。会場の案内を用意して、変更をどう知らせるか、始める前に説明したいと思います。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D018-01",
    "C76-D018-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 139.986,
   "end_sec": 148.275,
   "duration_sec": 8.289
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "田辺",
   "source_text": "連絡を読むのが遅れた人への配慮も必要です。知らせたから大丈夫だ、とは考えないでほしいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D019-01",
    "C76-D019-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 148.625,
   "end_sec": 155.267,
   "duration_sec": 6.642
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "賛成です。利用者が確認しやすい方法を相談しましょう。私も、その相談には参加できます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D020-01",
    "C76-D020-02",
    "C76-D020-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 155.617,
   "end_sec": 162.93,
   "duration_sec": 7.313
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D021",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "小野",
   "source_text": "では、連絡方法は今後相談する、と残します。青木さん、相談の準備をお願いしてもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D021-01",
    "C76-D021-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-2",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 163.28,
   "end_sec": 169.909,
   "duration_sec": 6.629
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D022",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "はい、準備します。確認が終わったことと、まだ決まっていないことを分けてまとめます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D022-01",
    "C76-D022-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 170.259,
   "end_sec": 176.3,
   "duration_sec": 6.041
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D023",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "田辺",
   "source_text": "三か月目に見直すそうですが、計画全体を三か月で終える可能性を前提にしていますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D023-01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 176.65,
   "end_sec": 183.845,
   "duration_sec": 7.195
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D024",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "小野",
   "source_text": "計画は六か月です。三か月目の末に出席状況と負担を確認し、その後の三か月の調整を考えます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D024-01",
    "C76-D024-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-2",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 184.195,
   "end_sec": 192.203,
   "duration_sec": 8.008
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D025",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "まだ始めていませんから、負担が減ったとは書けませんね。調べる予定と結果は分ける必要があります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D025-01",
    "C76-D025-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 192.553,
   "end_sec": 200.222,
   "duration_sec": 7.669
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D026",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "はい。説明文には資料の出典も書きます。数字を使うときは、回答した人の範囲も残します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D026-01",
    "C76-D026-02",
    "C76-D026-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 200.572,
   "end_sec": 207.82,
   "duration_sec": 7.248
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D027",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "田辺",
   "source_text": "それなら、B案を暫定的に選ぶことには同意します。場所への不安は、留保した点として残してください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D027-01",
    "C76-D027-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-storyteller-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 208.17,
   "end_sec": 215.83,
   "duration_sec": 7.66
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D028",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "私も賛成です。ただし、経路の確認を省く例外は認めたくありません。その条件は変えないでください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D028-01",
    "C76-D028-02",
    "C76-D028-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 216.18,
   "end_sec": 223.959,
   "duration_sec": 7.779
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D029",
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "承知しました。全員が条件なしで賛成した、とは書きません。選択の根拠と残った条件を示します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D029-01",
    "C76-D029-02",
    "C76-D029-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 224.309,
   "end_sec": 232.977,
   "duration_sec": 8.668
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D030",
   "turn_index": 29,
   "speaker": "小野",
   "source_text": "今日の合意を確認しましょう。経路と毎月の会場の確認を前提とするB案の暫定選択で、実施の決定ではない、という理解で同じですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D030-01",
    "C76-D030-02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-2",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 233.327,
   "end_sec": 243.874,
   "duration_sec": 10.547
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C76-D031",
   "turn_index": 30,
   "speaker": "青木",
   "source_text": "はい、その理解です。説明文でも「暫定的に選ぶ」と書きます。経路と会場を確認した結果は、今回の合意と分けて記録します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C76-D031-01",
    "C76-D031-02",
    "C76-D031-03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-csagent-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 244.224,
   "end_sec": 255.152,
   "duration_sec": 10.928
  }
 ],
 "sentence_intervals": [
